{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年65歲、80年代TVB當家花旦周秀蘭，當年憑藉清麗脫俗、楚楚可憐的古典美貌，迅速躋身TVB力捧之列。</p><p>要數其演藝生涯最深入民心的代表作，非1984年梁朝偉主演經典劇集《鹿鼎記》中的「雙兒」一角莫屬，她將雙兒溫柔體貼、重情重義的性格演繹得絲</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T04:25:33.156601+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T04:01:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T04:18:46.459605+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T04:18:46.459605+00:00","content_hash":"318ea2f534bd33fe3e9c514b0189e0d47d1313f9c48a979be46e6708eb942bc5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}